<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's WPI drops 0.9 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Morocco's WPI drops 0.9 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Wholesale Price Index dropped 0.9 percent in September to 356.2 points from 359.6 in August, the Statistics Directorate said in its latest bulletin on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    MOROCCO WHOLESALE PRICES   Sept 96   Aug 96</p>
<p>    Index			     356.2     359.6</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (percent)     -0.9	 N/A</p>
<p>Note - The average index for the nine first months of the year rose 5.6 percent compared with the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The September fall came mainly from a 1.3 percent drop in farm product prices and a 0.7 percent drop in industrial prices.</p>
</text>
